    "detailed_description": "Never a bad deal. Always a <strong>RAD DEAL</strong>!<br><br>This is <strong>Radical Solitaire</strong>! You can <strong>GET RAD</strong> and swap a card with any face-down card any time you want. It's not always easy, but it's always winnable**... unlike regular boring loser solitaire like your dad plays.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1264800/extras/6d47c31309371cc448529f16e07dd085.poster.avif?t=1660932144\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1264800/extras/6d47c31309371cc448529f16e07dd085.gif?t=1660932144\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div><br><br>Take a trip back to 1982 and waste a little time* with <strong>Radical Solitaire</strong>.<br><br><i>*best when played at work!  <br>**Photosensitive folks: You can disable the flashing effect with [F6]</i><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1264800/extras/586cc81767fe19c38cf36125f15fd406.poster.avif?t=1660932144\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1264800/extras/586cc81767fe19c38cf36125f15fd406.gif?t=1660932144\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div>",
